# SSH allowed_signers file for review approvals (see ssh-keygen(1), ALLOWED SIGNERS).
# Copy to config/approval-signers in the agent-comms checkout, replace the placeholder
# with the approver's public key, and commit it on the approval integration branch
# (default: main, override with AGENT_COMMS_APPROVAL_INTEGRATION_REF). Approval reads the
# committed file from that branch, not the working tree. The principal must stay
# agent-comms-approver.
agent-comms-approver ssh-ed25519 REPLACE_WITH_APPROVER_PUBLIC_KEY approver@example.com
